“Aren’t you afraid?”

“Of Mike?”

“Of all of them.”

“No.” Sam had come back to where they sat, and took the thermos from Val to inhale the hot fumes, closing her eyes in pleasure. “No I am not afraid. I have to do this and I will do it.”

